        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for a direct embeddings API task set, using Google's services for the integrations. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files can contain configuration, normalization, or parsing utilities. I need to create the specified files with the required integrations and helper utilities. </thinking>\n",
